{\an8}<i>Fireflies play with fire</i>

115
00:08:14,916 --> 00:08:18,666
{\an8}<i>Fireflies play with fire</i>

116
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:22,416
{\an8}<i>They kiss the flame
Even if it kills them</i>

117
